    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Flair Elegance is a dog groomer on route de Montferrat in Draguignan (83300). Its Instagram account, @flair_elegance, describes it as a "dog groomer in Draguignan (83)", mentioned in Var-Matin, and shows dog grooming work, including a hand-stripping to keep a natural coat.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The address is 871 route de Montferrat (sometimes written "avenue de Montferrat" in directories), 83300 Draguignan. The business appears in the ToilettageCanin.fr directory, which reuses public company registers (activity code 96.09Z). The published phone number is 07 66 76 63 09. The salon has no website of its own: the public channel is its Instagram account.</p>
      <p>Prices, opening hours, the list of accepted breeds and booking terms are not published in official sources. A call before you go lets you give your dog's breed and size and ask about prices and availability.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: mention your dog's breed and size when booking, especially for a large dog, so the slot is planned accordingly.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Draguignan, a sub-prefecture of the Var, is close to several villages of the inland Var: grooming can be combined with a leashed walk in the area, checking the rules of each place before you set off.</p>

      <h2>Worth checking before you go</h2>
      <p>Opening hours, prices and how large dogs are handled are not published: call before you travel.</p>
